   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n    <li>Which of the following is the domain of the function graphed below?</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img src=\"exercises/media/42c8071c4ebcb5a2.jpg\" width=\"300\" alt=\"A piecewise linear graph, labeled 'h', is shown on a coordinate plane from x=-7 to 7 and y=-7 to 7. The graph starts at (-5,4), goes to (-3,3), then to (0,7), then (3,1), and ends at (5,-5).\"></p>",
